{"seq":2,"slug":"ble-bluetooth-low-energy","title":"BLE 蓝牙低功耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols/ble-bluetooth-low-energy","wordCount":786,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ble-蓝牙低功耗\">BLE 蓝牙低功耗</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>蓝牙低功耗（Bluetooth Low Energy, BLE）是蓝牙 4.0 引入的低功耗无线通信技术，专为 IoT 设备设计。与经典蓝牙（Classic Bluetooth）不同，BLE 优化了极低功耗和快速连接——设备可以在毫秒内建立连接，以微安级平均电流运行数年。BLE 是智能穿戴、信标、传感器网络和近场交互的核心连接技术。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[BLE 协议栈] --&gt; B[应用层]&#10;    A --&gt; C[主机层 Host]&#10;    A --&gt; D[控制器层 Controller]&#10;    B --&gt; E[GATT Profile]&#10;    B --&gt; F[GAP Profile]&#10;    C --&gt; G[ATT 属性协议]&#10;    C --&gt; H[SMP 安全管理]&#10;    C --&gt; I[L2CAP]&#10;    D --&gt; J[Link Layer 链路层]&#10;    D --&gt; K[PHY 物理层]\">graph TD\n    A[BLE 协议栈] --&gt; B[应用层]\n    A --&gt; C[主机层 Host]\n    A --&gt; D[控制器层 Controller]\n    B --&gt; E[GATT Profile]\n    B --&gt; F[GAP Profile]\n    C --&gt; G[ATT 属性协议]\n    C --&gt; H[SMP 安全管理]\n    C --&gt; I[L2CAP]\n    D --&gt; J[Link Layer 链路层]\n    D --&gt; K[PHY 物理层]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>BLE 5.x</th>\n<th>Classic BT</th>\n<th>WiFi</th>\n<th>Zigbee</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>功耗</td>\n<td>μW-mW</td>\n<td>mW-数十 mW</td>\n<td>数十-数百 mW</td>\n<td>μW-mW</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围</td>\n<td>10-400m</td>\n<td>10-100m</td>\n<td>50-100m</td>\n<td>10-100m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速率</td>\n<td>125Kbps-2Mbps</td>\n<td>1-3Mbps</td>\n<td>11-600Mbps</td>\n<td>250Kbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接时间</td>\n<td>~3ms</td>\n<td>~100ms</td>\n<td>~1-3s</td>\n<td>~30ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拓扑</td>\n<td>星形/Mesh</td>\n<td>点对点/星形</td>\n<td>星形</td>\n<td>Mesh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点数</td>\n<td>理论无限</td>\n<td>7 活跃</td>\n<td>~30</td>\n<td>~65000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频段</td>\n<td>2.4GHz</td>\n<td>2.4GHz</td>\n<td>2.4/5GHz</td>\n<td>2.4GHz</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gatt-与-att-属性系统\">GATT 与 ATT 属性系统</h2><p>GATT（Generic Attribute Profile）是 BLE 数据交互的核心框架。数据组织为 Service → Characteristic → Descriptor 的层次结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 自定义环境监测服务&#10;// Service UUID: 0x181A (Environmental Sensing)&#10;//   ├── Temperature Characteristic (0x2A6E)&#10;//   │   ├── Value: int16 (0.01°C 精度)&#10;//   │   ├── Client Characteristic Configuration Descriptor (CCCD)&#10;//   │   └── Characteristic User Description&#10;//   ├── Humidity Characteristic (0x2A6F)&#10;//   │   ├── Value: uint16 (0.01% 精度)&#10;//   │   └── CCCD&#10;//   └── Battery Level Characteristic (0x2A19)&#10;//       └── Value: uint8 (0-100%)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自定义环境监测服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Service UUID: 0x181A (Environmental Sensing)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   ├── Temperature Characteristic (0x2A6E)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   │   ├── Value: int16 (0.01°C 精度)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   │   ├── Client Characteristic Configuration Descriptor (CCCD)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   │   └── Characteristic User Description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   ├── Humidity Characteristic (0x2A6F)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   │   ├── Value: uint16 (0.01% 精度)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   │   └── CCCD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   └── Battery Level Characteristic (0x2A19)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       └── Value: uint8 (0-100%)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Zephyr BLE 服务定义</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"BT_GATT_SERVICE_DEFINE(env_svc,&#10;    BT_GATT_PRIMARY_SERVICE(BT_UUID_ESS),&#10;    BT_GATT_CHARACTERISTIC(BT_UUID_TEMPERATURE,&#10;        BT_GATT_CHRC_READ | BT_GATT_CHRC_NOTIFY,&#10;        BT_GATT_PERM_READ,&#10;        read_temp, NULL, &amp;temperature),&#10;    BT_GATT_CCC(temp_ccc_changed, BT_GATT_PERM_READ | BT_GATT_PERM_WRITE),&#10;    BT_GATT_CHARACTERISTIC(BT_UUID_HUMIDITY,&#10;        BT_GATT_CHRC_READ | BT_GATT_CHRC_NOTIFY,&#10;        BT_GATT_PERM_READ,&#10;        read_hum, NULL, &amp;humidity),&#10;    BT_GATT_CCC(hum_ccc_changed, BT_GATT_PERM_READ | BT_GATT_PERM_WRITE),&#10;);&#10;&#10;static ssize_t read_temp(struct bt_conn *conn,&#10;    const struct bt_gatt_attr *attr, void *buf,&#10;    uint16_t len, uint16_t offset)&#10;{&#10;    return bt_gatt_attr_read(conn, attr, buf, len, offset,&#10;        &amp;temperature, sizeof(temperature));&#10;}&#10;&#10;void notify_temperature(int16_t temp) {&#10;    temperature = temp;&#10;    bt_gatt_notify(NULL, &amp;env_svc.attrs[1], &amp;temperature, sizeof(temperature));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BT_GATT_SERVICE_DEFINE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(env_svc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_GATT_PRIMARY_SERVICE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_UUID_ESS),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_GATT_CHARACTERISTIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_UUID_TEMPERATURE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        BT_GATT_CHRC_READ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BT_GATT_CHRC_NOTIFY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        BT_GATT_PERM_READ,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        read_temp, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">temperature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_GATT_CCC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(temp_ccc_changed, BT_GATT_PERM_READ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BT_GATT_PERM_WRITE),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_GATT_CHARACTERISTIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_UUID_HUMIDITY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        BT_GATT_CHRC_READ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BT_GATT_CHRC_NOTIFY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        BT_GATT_PERM_READ,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        read_hum, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">humidity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_GATT_CCC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hum_ccc_changed, BT_GATT_PERM_READ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BT_GATT_PERM_WRITE),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ssize_t</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> read_temp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">conn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_gatt_attr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> offset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bt_gatt_attr_read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(conn, attr, buf, len, offset,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">temperature, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(temperature));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> notify_temperature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int16_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> temp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    temperature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    bt_gatt_notify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env_svc.attrs[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">temperature, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(temperature));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GATT 操作</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>触发方</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Read</td>\n<td>Client → Server</td>\n<td>客户端请求</td>\n<td>读取当前值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write</td>\n<td>Client → Server</td>\n<td>客户端请求</td>\n<td>发送命令/配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Notify</td>\n<td>Server → Client</td>\n<td>服务端主动</td>\n<td>实时数据推送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indicate</td>\n<td>Server → Client</td>\n<td>服务端主动</td>\n<td>可靠数据推送（需确认）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"广播与扫描\">广播与扫描</h2><p>BLE 广播是无连接的单向通信，设备通过广播包（Advertisement）发送数据。BLE 5.0 的扩展广播支持高达 254 字节的载荷：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// Zephyr BLE 广播配置&#10;static const struct bt_data ad[] = {&#10;    BT_DATA_BYTES(BT_DATA_FLAGS, (BT_LE_AD_GENERAL | BT_LE_AD_NO_BREDR)),&#10;    BT_DATA_BYTES(BT_DATA_UUID16_ALL, BT_UUID_16_ENCODE(0x181A)),&#10;    BT_DATA(BT_DATA_NAME_COMPLETE, DEVICE_NAME, sizeof(DEVICE_NAME) - 1),&#10;};&#10;&#10;static const struct bt_data sd[] = {&#10;    BT_DATA(BT_DATA_MANUFACTURER_SPECIFIC, mfg_data, sizeof(mfg_data)),&#10;};&#10;&#10;int startAdvertising(void) {&#10;    return bt_le_adv_start(BT_LE_ADV_CONN, ad, ARRAY_SIZE(ad), sd, ARRAY_SIZE(sd));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Zephyr BLE 广播配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_data ad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_DATA_BYTES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_DATA_FLAGS, (BT_LE_AD_GENERAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BT_LE_AD_NO_BREDR)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_DATA_BYTES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_DATA_UUID16_ALL, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BT_UUID_16_ENCODE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">181A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_DATA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_DATA_NAME_COMPLETE, DEVICE_NAME, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(DEVICE_NAME) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_data sd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_DATA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_DATA_MANUFACTURER_SPECIFIC, mfg_data, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mfg_data)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> startAdvertising</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bt_le_adv_start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_LE_ADV_CONN, ad, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ARRAY_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ad), sd, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ARRAY_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sd));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>广播类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>可连接</th>\n<th>可扫描</th>\n<th>定向</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ADV_IND</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>通用可连接广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADV_DIRECT_IND</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>快速重连</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADV_SCAN_IND</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>信标（扫描可获取更多数据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADV_NONCONN_IND</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>纯广播信标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADV_EXT_IND (5.0)</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>扩展广播（254 字节）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ble-连接参数优化\">BLE 连接参数优化</h2><p>连接参数直接影响功耗和吞吐量的平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 连接参数协商&#10;struct bt_le_conn_param param = {&#10;    .interval_min = 80,    // 100ms（80 × 1.25ms）&#10;    .interval_max = 160,   // 200ms（160 × 1.25ms）&#10;    .latency = 4,          // 允许跳过 4 个连接事件&#10;    .timeout = 400,        // 5s 超时（400 × 10ms）&#10;};&#10;bt_conn_le_param_update(conn, &amp;param);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 连接参数协商</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_le_conn_param param </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .interval_min </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 100ms（80 × 1.25ms）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .interval_max </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 160</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 200ms（160 × 1.25ms）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .latency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 允许跳过 4 个连接事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .timeout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 5s 超时（400 × 10ms）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bt_conn_le_param_update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(conn, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">param</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>最小值</th>\n<th>最大值</th>\n<th>功耗影响</th>\n<th>延迟影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连接间隔</td>\n<td>7.5ms</td>\n<td>4s</td>\n<td>间隔越大功耗越低</td>\n<td>间隔越大延迟越高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从设备延迟</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>499</td>\n<td>延迟越大功耗越低</td>\n<td>响应更慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监督超时</td>\n<td>100ms</td>\n<td>32s</td>\n<td>间接影响</td>\n<td>断线检测速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PHY</td>\n<td>1M</td>\n<td>Coded(125K)</td>\n<td>Coded 更远但更慢</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ble-mesh-网络\">BLE Mesh 网络</h2><p>BLE Mesh 基于 BLE 广播实现多跳网状网络，适用于智能照明、楼宇自动化等大规模部署场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[手机 Provisioner] --&gt;|配网| B[节点 1 Relay]&#10;    B --&gt;|转发| C[节点 2 Relay]&#10;    C --&gt;|转发| D[节点 3 End]&#10;    B --&gt;|转发| E[节点 4 End]&#10;    C --&gt;|转发| F[节点 5 Friend]&#10;    F -.-&gt;|缓存消息| G[节点 6 Low Power]\">graph TD\n    A[手机 Provisioner] --&gt;|配网| B[节点 1 Relay]\n    B --&gt;|转发| C[节点 2 Relay]\n    C --&gt;|转发| D[节点 3 End]\n    B --&gt;|转发| E[节点 4 End]\n    C --&gt;|转发| F[节点 5 Friend]\n    F -.-&gt;|缓存消息| G[节点 6 Low Power]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>典型设备</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Relay Node</td>\n<td>转发消息</td>\n<td>智能灯（常供电）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Low Power Node</td>\n<td>低功耗，依赖 Friend</td>\n<td>传感器（电池）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Friend Node</td>\n<td>为 LPN 缓存消息</td>\n<td>智能插座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Proxy Node</td>\n<td>BLE GATT ↔ Mesh 桥接</td>\n<td>网关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provisioner</td>\n<td>配网和密钥分发</td>\n<td>手机/平板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>BLE 专为低功耗和快速连接设计，μA 级平均电流可实现数年电池续航</li>\n<li>GATT 层次结构（Service→Characteristic→Descriptor）是 BLE 数据交互的核心</li>\n<li>广播是无连接单向通信，BLE 5.0 扩展广播支持 254 字节载荷</li>\n<li>连接参数（间隔、延迟、超时）直接决定功耗和响应性的平衡</li>\n<li>BLE Mesh 通过多跳广播实现大规模网状网络，Relay/Friend/LPN 角色协同覆盖异构节点需求</li>\n<li>BLE 5.x 的 2M PHY 提升吞吐量，Coded PHY 扩展通信距离至 400m+</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"BLE 蓝牙低功耗","id":"ble-蓝牙低功耗"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GATT 与 ATT 属性系统","id":"gatt-与-att-属性系统"},{"level":2,"text":"广播与扫描","id":"广播与扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"BLE 连接参数优化","id":"ble-连接参数优化"},{"level":2,"text":"BLE Mesh 网络","id":"ble-mesh-网络"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MQTT 协议架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols/mqtt-protocol"},"next":{"title":"LoRa 与 LPWAN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols/lora-and-lpwan"}}